{"source": "/home/ubuntu/shiva-study-set/Shiva Sutras 3.38.mp3", "engine": "faster-whisper-base", "segments": [{"t": 0.34, "end": 7.14, "text": "Yatashcha karna shakti shabdoktya, next, Yatashcha karna shakti shabdoktya,"}, {"t": 7.14, "end": 10.14, "text": "Turyatma, Swatantarshaktir eva,"}, {"t": 10.14, "end": 12.34, "text": "Bhooduru paisipramatu saram,"}, {"t": 12.34, "end": 17.34, "text": "Oto maya shakti aphasitit tatsurup utthye janaya."}, {"t": 18.34, "end": 21.34, "text": "So, when it is proved,"}, {"t": 21.34, "end": 27.34, "text": "that by this word, karna shakti, the power of doing and undoing,"}, {"t": 27.34, "end": 31.68, "text": "the essence of that power of undoing and doing,"}, {"t": 31.68, "end": 35.68, "text": "is Turyatma, Bhooduru paisipramatu saram,"}, {"t": 35.68, "end": 41.68, "text": "is the essence of pramata, which is one with Turya."}, {"t": 42.68, "end": 43.68, "text": "And that is Swatantarshakti."}, {"t": 43.68, "end": 47.68, "text": "Swatantarshakti, it is only power of Swatantrya,"}, {"t": 47.68, "end": 49.68, "text": "power of absolute independence,"}, {"t": 49.68, "end": 58.28, "text": "that carries you to that supreme state of perfect top,"}, {"t": 58.28, "end": 59.28, "text": "supreme top."}, {"t": 61.28, "end": 65.28, "text": "So, maya shakti aphasitit tatsurup utthye janaya."}, {"t": 65.28, "end": 70.28, "text": "When by maya shakti, by the power of illusion,"}, {"t": 71.28, "end": 75.28, "text": "your power is subsided."}, {"t": 76.28, "end": 81.28, "text": "Just to give rise to that subsided power again,"}, {"t": 82.28, "end": 84.28, "text": "what you should do for that,"}, {"t": 85.28, "end": 87.28, "text": "Tripada danuparananam."}, {"t": 88.28, "end": 90.28, "text": "You have to do this thing,"}, {"t": 90.28, "end": 93.28, "text": "that as soon as you come out from samadhi,"}, {"t": 93.28, "end": 96.28, "text": "as soon as you come out from Turya state,"}, {"t": 97.28, "end": 105.88, "text": "you just insert the absolute bliss of that Turya state,"}, {"t": 106.88, "end": 110.88, "text": "by and by in wakefulness, in dreaming state and in dreaming state."}, {"t": 110.88, "end": 116.13, "text": "Tripada, Tripada means wakefulness, dreaming state,"}, {"t": 116.13, "end": 118.13, "text": "dreaming state and dreamless state."}, {"t": 118.13, "end": 125.13, "text": "In these three states, you have to insert that absolute bliss of God consciousness,"}, {"t": 125.13, "end": 130.13, "text": "by and by, so that all these four states become one,"}, {"t": 130.13, "end": 133.13, "text": "without any distinction."}, {"t": 133.13, "end": 140.11, "text": "So, all these states become one with Turya."}, {"t": 140.11, "end": 143.11, "text": "That is Tripada danuparananam."}, {"t": 143.11, "end": 147.68, "text": "Just like that,"}, {"t": 148.68, "end": 151.68, "text": "Treyanam bhaav anma ki,"}, {"t": 151.68, "end": 155.68, "text": "tath abhishung tath antur dhukki bhaav na maya nam."}, {"t": 155.68, "end": 159.68, "text": "Sreshtis tithi layshap dhuktanam, padhanam avasthanam."}, {"t": 159.68, "end": 164.68, "text": "These three states, which are bhaav anma kiya,"}, {"t": 165.68, "end": 168.68, "text": "just when you are diverted towards some object,"}, {"t": 169.68, "end": 173.68, "text": "you are not diverted, you are going to be diverted."}, {"t": 173.68, "end": 177.68, "text": "You are about to divert your consciousness towards object."}, {"t": 177.68, "end": 182.68, "text": "Your consciousness is not diverted."}, {"t": 182.68, "end": 186.68, "text": "It has begun to divert."}, {"t": 187.68, "end": 189.68, "text": "This is bhaav anma kiya."}, {"t": 189.68, "end": 192.68, "text": "This is meant by bhaav anma kiya."}, {"t": 192.68, "end": 195.68, "text": "Abhishunga, when your consciousness is diverted,"}, {"t": 195.68, "end": 199.68, "text": "absolutely towards that object, that is bhaav abhishunga."}, {"t": 200.68, "end": 203.68, "text": "Tath antur ma ki bhaav na,"}, {"t": 203.68, "end": 210.76, "text": "then when your consciousness is carried away from one object"}, {"t": 210.76, "end": 216.76, "text": "and it is going to get insertion in another object."}, {"t": 217.76, "end": 222.76, "text": "Insertion is another object that is bhaav anma kiya for another object."}, {"t": 222.76, "end": 228.76, "text": "For this, it is antur, bhaav anma ki bhaav."}, {"t": 228.76, "end": 234.76, "text": "Bhaav has entered an internal consciousness."}, {"t": 234.76, "end": 237.46, "text": "Have you understood?"}, {"t": 237.46, "end": 241.86, "text": "When you perceive this spec,"}, {"t": 241.86, "end": 243.86, "text": "you are going to perceive this spec."}, {"t": 243.86, "end": 247.86, "text": "First is the state when you are going to perceive this spec."}, {"t": 247.86, "end": 249.86, "text": "This is bhaav anma kiya."}, {"t": 249.86, "end": 250.86, "text": "This is first state."}, {"t": 250.86, "end": 253.86, "text": "Next state is when you are perceiving this spec."}, {"t": 253.86, "end": 259.78, "text": "This is bhaav abhishunga."}, {"t": 259.78, "end": 263.78, "text": "Then you have perceived this spec."}, {"t": 264.78, "end": 266.78, "text": "That is bhaav abhishunga."}, {"t": 266.78, "end": 268.78, "text": "Then you have perceived this spec."}, {"t": 268.78, "end": 269.78, "text": "What happens next?"}, {"t": 269.78, "end": 275.78, "text": "It happens that there is no curiosity ends to perceive it."}, {"t": 275.78, "end": 278.78, "text": "When curiosity ends to perceive it, you perceive another object"}, {"t": 278.78, "end": 281.78, "text": "because this is the way of perception in this world."}, {"t": 281.78, "end": 285.78, "text": "You are going to perceive another object that is book."}, {"t": 286.78, "end": 289.78, "text": "For book, it is bhaav anma kiya."}, {"t": 289.78, "end": 292.78, "text": "For this, it is bhaav anma."}, {"t": 292.78, "end": 295.78, "text": "It has entered in your god consciousness."}, {"t": 295.78, "end": 296.78, "text": "Where?"}, {"t": 296.78, "end": 299.78, "text": "Of absolute shunya."}, {"t": 299.78, "end": 302.78, "text": "Have you understood?"}, {"t": 302.78, "end": 306.78, "text": "Bhaav anma kiya, bhaav abhishunga and bhaav antherma kiya."}, {"t": 306.78, "end": 310.78, "text": "Bhaav antherma kiya for this, bhaav anma kiya for next."}, {"t": 310.78, "end": 315.22, "text": "For this, bhaav anma kiya, then bhaav abhishunga"}, {"t": 315.22, "end": 322.22, "text": "and bhaav antherma kiya for this and bhaav anma kiya for another trouble."}, {"t": 323.22, "end": 326.22, "text": "So on, it goes like that."}, {"t": 326.22, "end": 329.22, "text": "But this chain of perception,"}, {"t": 329.22, "end": 333.22, "text": "it is why we are so much connected with Buddhists."}, {"t": 333.22, "end": 340.22, "text": "They also agree that it is the frags of knowledge,"}, {"t": 340.22, "end": 343.22, "text": "knowing from one to another."}, {"t": 344.22, "end": 348.22, "text": "It is why we are so fond of Buddhism."}, {"t": 348.22, "end": 352.59, "text": "We are not fond of Buddhism to have it"}, {"t": 352.59, "end": 360.94, "text": "just to discard it."}, {"t": 360.94, "end": 363.94, "text": "And that is in other way, in other words,"}, {"t": 363.94, "end": 366.94, "text": "it is called Sreshti, Sriti and Lai."}, {"t": 366.94, "end": 368.94, "text": "Sreshti is bhaav anma kiya."}, {"t": 368.94, "end": 370.94, "text": "Sriti is bhaav abhishunga."}, {"t": 370.94, "end": 372.94, "text": "Lai is bhaav antherma kiya."}, {"t": 372.94, "end": 376.94, "text": "When your curiosity ends there."}, {"t": 376.94, "end": 379.94, "text": "Sriti lai shabdoktanam, padanam, avasthanam."}, {"t": 379.94, "end": 381.94, "text": "These are three states."}, {"t": 381.94, "end": 383.94, "text": "Yath aadi pradanam."}, {"t": 384.94, "end": 389.94, "text": "That which is residing in each and every point,"}, {"t": 389.94, "end": 392.94, "text": "in these triple states."}, {"t": 392.94, "end": 397.94, "text": "That is, Tricamat kirtitena anandaganam turya kampadam."}, {"t": 397.94, "end": 400.94, "text": "That is the state of turya,"}, {"t": 400.94, "end": 407.41, "text": "which is filled with bliss and gets the enjoyment,"}, {"t": 407.41, "end": 411.41, "text": "gets the bliss of all these three."}, {"t": 412.41, "end": 414.41, "text": "Maya shakti acha jitama bhi."}, {"t": 414.41, "end": 420.41, "text": "Although it is existing in Maya shakti."}, {"t": 420.41, "end": 424.41, "text": "Although it is covered by the energy of illusion."}, {"t": 424.41, "end": 428.41, "text": "But still, tattas vishi ubhola aadi avasare ifu."}, {"t": 428.41, "end": 434.82, "text": "Then you are enjoying all these enjoyment of senses."}, {"t": 434.82, "end": 440.29, "text": "In the beginning, in the center and in the end."}, {"t": 441.29, "end": 444.29, "text": "In the beginning of enjoyment of senses."}, {"t": 444.29, "end": 447.29, "text": "And in the center of enjoyment of senses."}, {"t": 447.29, "end": 450.29, "text": "And in the end of curiosity is over."}, {"t": 458.52, "end": 461.52, "text": "Turya kampadam is residing in three states."}, {"t": 461.52, "end": 469.73, "text": "In the state, in the world, in the field of objective world."}, {"t": 472.14, "end": 477.14, "text": "There is Maya shakti because there are three."}, {"t": 477.14, "end": 481.51, "text": "When there is differentiation, that is Maya shakti."}, {"t": 481.51, "end": 482.51, "text": "Bheod is Maya."}, {"t": 482.51, "end": 484.51, "text": "Different state perception is Maya."}, {"t": 484.51, "end": 487.51, "text": "When there is bhava on makyav, separate."}, {"t": 487.51, "end": 489.51, "text": "Bhava abhishinga, separate."}, {"t": 489.51, "end": 491.51, "text": "And bhava antarmukha, separate."}, {"t": 491.51, "end": 492.51, "text": "That is Maya."}, {"t": 492.51, "end": 496.51, "text": "Although it is Maya, but it is Maya tir."}, {"t": 496.51, "end": 499.51, "text": "It is why he has put api."}, {"t": 499.51, "end": 501.51, "text": "He has put api for Maya."}, {"t": 501.51, "end": 504.51, "text": "Maya shakti achaditam api."}, {"t": 504.51, "end": 508.51, "text": "Although it is residing in the field of Maya shakti."}, {"t": 508.51, "end": 511.51, "text": "But tattati veshi ubhoga adiyava sayeshu,"}, {"t": 511.51, "end": 513.51, "text": "we do thought aba asamanam."}, {"t": 513.51, "end": 518.51, "text": "That Turya is felt just like a flash of lightning."}, {"t": 518.51, "end": 521.51, "text": "Just for one second."}, {"t": 521.51, "end": 527.51, "text": "One second, it gives, it is really you there."}, {"t": 530.59, "end": 534.59, "text": "And there is only the trick of master,"}, {"t": 534.59, "end": 538.94, "text": "how to hold it at that point."}, {"t": 538.94, "end": 543.94, "text": "By chance, when you take a piece of cheese,"}, {"t": 543.94, "end": 547.94, "text": "well, well boiled, well cooked, and you taste it."}, {"t": 547.94, "end": 550.94, "text": "At the time of that tasting, that cheese."}, {"t": 550.94, "end": 556.94, "text": "Although that tasting of cheese is deciding in the Maya shakti."}, {"t": 556.94, "end": 559.94, "text": "It is covered by Maya shakti, covered by the illusion of Maya."}, {"t": 560.94, "end": 563.94, "text": "But we do thought aba asamanam."}, {"t": 563.94, "end": 566.94, "text": "Just like lightning, that is found."}, {"t": 566.94, "end": 569.94, "text": "That God consciousness found in that taste,"}, {"t": 569.94, "end": 573.76, "text": "in the beginning."}, {"t": 573.76, "end": 576.76, "text": "And if by the grace of master,"}, {"t": 576.76, "end": 580.76, "text": "you have power, you have capacity to hold it."}, {"t": 580.76, "end": 582.76, "text": "Then you are there."}, {"t": 582.76, "end": 584.76, "text": "Then you get entry in that God consciousness."}, {"t": 584.76, "end": 589.9, "text": "It is just a trick."}, {"t": 589.9, "end": 592.9, "text": "It is not moving here and there."}, {"t": 593.9, "end": 596.9, "text": "With breath, that won't do."}, {"t": 596.9, "end": 599.9, "text": "It is a trick to hold that awareness."}, {"t": 599.9, "end": 602.9, "text": "By trick, you can hold that God consciousness."}, {"t": 602.9, "end": 606.9, "text": "Not by prayer, not by weeping, not by worship,"}, {"t": 606.9, "end": 610.9, "text": "not by anything else, only by trick of awareness."}, {"t": 615.66, "end": 618.66, "text": "It is a trick, yes."}, {"t": 618.66, "end": 620.66, "text": "There are so many Vedas,"}, {"t": 621.66, "end": 625.66, "text": "they pray lifelong, they pray without any result."}, {"t": 625.66, "end": 627.66, "text": "What is there in it?"}, {"t": 627.66, "end": 630.66, "text": "It is only trick how to hold it."}, {"t": 632.66, "end": 636.66, "text": "How can that trick, that trick can be taught by your master."}, {"t": 643.66, "end": 645.66, "text": "At that point, when it is held,"}, {"t": 646.66, "end": 648.66, "text": "till then there is trick."}, {"t": 649.66, "end": 653.66, "text": "When it is held, then there is no trick."}, {"t": 653.66, "end": 655.66, "text": "Trick ends, yes."}, {"t": 655.66, "end": 661.2, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 661.2, "end": 665.2, "text": "In the pregaanam trichamat kirtit tena anandaganam triachampadam,"}, {"t": 665.2, "end": 667.2, "text": "if maya sirti aachai tathvan,"}, {"t": 667.2, "end": 670.2, "text": "although it is covered by the energy of illusion,"}, {"t": 670.2, "end": 673.2, "text": "but tathatvishi upoga, the outside issue,"}, {"t": 673.2, "end": 676.2, "text": "at the time of enjoyment of those senses,"}, {"t": 676.2, "end": 678.2, "text": "Vedas vatha ubhaasinam,"}, {"t": 678.2, "end": 681.2, "text": "that God consciousness is shining,"}, {"t": 681.2, "end": 684.2, "text": "just like a lightning,"}, {"t": 684.2, "end": 687.2, "text": "for one second, in a flash."}, {"t": 687.2, "end": 689.2, "text": "Tena tathathav sayreshu,"}, {"t": 689.2, "end": 691.2, "text": "but what you have to do there,"}, {"t": 691.2, "end": 692.2, "text": "tathathav sayreshu,"}, {"t": 692.2, "end": 695.2, "text": "at those points,"}, {"t": 695.2, "end": 697.2, "text": "at those points of lightning,"}, {"t": 697.2, "end": 700.2, "text": "you have to be absolutely aware."}, {"t": 700.2, "end": 703.96, "text": "If you are not aware, finish it."}, {"t": 703.96, "end": 706.96, "text": "You are as good as the individual doing it."}, {"t": 706.96, "end": 709.56, "text": "Tathathav sayreshu,"}, {"t": 709.56, "end": 714.56, "text": "although it rises only for one second,"}, {"t": 714.56, "end": 717.56, "text": "but you have to unopronom,"}, {"t": 717.56, "end": 719.56, "text": "you have to give life to it,"}, {"t": 719.56, "end": 721.56, "text": "with awareness,"}, {"t": 721.56, "end": 722.56, "text": "sustain it."}, {"t": 722.56, "end": 726.56, "text": "At the end of the pregaanam triachampadam,"}, {"t": 726.56, "end": 730.56, "text": "just hold it internally,"}, {"t": 730.56, "end": 736.56, "text": "by keeping your consciousness introverted."}, {"t": 737.56, "end": 741.56, "text": "Not by external consciousness."}, {"t": 741.56, "end": 743.56, "text": "Inverted consciousness,"}, {"t": 743.56, "end": 747.56, "text": "you will be successful in that."}, {"t": 747.56, "end": 749.56, "text": "That is, at the end of the pregaanam triachampadam,"}, {"t": 749.56, "end": 751.56, "text": "you will be successful in that,"}, {"t": 751.56, "end": 753.56, "text": "by that successful consciousness,"}, {"t": 753.56, "end": 757.56, "text": "unopronom, you must give life to that God consciousness,"}, {"t": 757.56, "end": 760.56, "text": "which is held for one second there."}, {"t": 760.56, "end": 761.56, "text": "What is this?"}, {"t": 761.56, "end": 763.56, "text": "This is really shambhupaya,"}, {"t": 763.56, "end": 764.56, "text": "this is shambhupaya."}, {"t": 764.56, "end": 765.56, "text": "This is shambhupaya,"}, {"t": 765.56, "end": 767.56, "text": "and unopaya."}, {"t": 773.56, "end": 774.56, "text": "Continue expansion."}, {"t": 774.56, "end": 776.56, "text": "Continue expansion, yes."}, {"t": 778.56, "end": 781.1, "text": "Atmanas,"}, {"t": 781.1, "end": 784.1, "text": "you have to give life to that God consciousness,"}, {"t": 784.1, "end": 787.1, "text": "you must give life to it again and again."}, {"t": 787.1, "end": 789.1, "text": "Again, in these moments,"}, {"t": 789.1, "end": 791.1, "text": "in these moments,"}, {"t": 791.1, "end": 793.1, "text": "or add these moments,"}, {"t": 793.1, "end": 795.1, "text": "I don't know English."}, {"t": 796.1, "end": 797.1, "text": "I am sorry."}, {"t": 798.1, "end": 799.1, "text": "Tadhu,"}, {"t": 799.1, "end": 802.1, "text": "you have to give life to that God consciousness."}, {"t": 802.1, "end": 804.1, "text": "If it is it, if it is it,"}, {"t": 804.1, "end": 805.1, "text": "if it is it,"}, {"t": 805.1, "end": 806.1, "text": "Antas,"}, {"t": 806.1, "end": 807.1, "text": "Anabhava, Nanda,"}, {"t": 807.1, "end": 810.1, "text": "Vikalpoorn, Muktu, Gochara, Yavastha, Barita, Karna,"}, {"t": 810.1, "end": 812.1, "text": "Bhairavi, Bhairavath, Manah,"}, {"t": 812.1, "end": 816.1, "text": "Tatvapu, Tatvoto, Gayam, Yamalam, Vishu, Puranam."}, {"t": 817.1, "end": 818.1, "text": "That state,"}, {"t": 818.1, "end": 822.1, "text": "which is filled with your own bliss of God consciousness,"}, {"t": 822.1, "end": 826.1, "text": "and which is deprived from all"}, {"t": 826.1, "end": 830.05, "text": "Vikalpoorn,"}, {"t": 830.05, "end": 833.05, "text": "differentiated perception of Vikalpoorn, thoughts,"}, {"t": 833.05, "end": 835.05, "text": "differentiated thoughts."}, {"t": 835.05, "end": 837.05, "text": "And that state,"}, {"t": 837.05, "end": 838.05, "text": "which is Barita-kara,"}, {"t": 838.05, "end": 841.05, "text": "always full of Bhairavi,"}, {"t": 841.05, "end": 845.97, "text": "and that state concerned with Bhairava."}, {"t": 845.97, "end": 847.97, "text": "Bhairavi, Bhairavi, Avastha,"}, {"t": 847.97, "end": 849.97, "text": "Bhairavath, Manah, Bhairavi, Avastha."}, {"t": 849.97, "end": 853.97, "text": "The state of Bhairavi pertaining to Bhairava."}, {"t": 854.97, "end": 856.97, "text": "Tatvapu, Tatvoto, Gayam, Yamalam."}, {"t": 856.97, "end": 862.97, "text": "That reality of state must be perceived,"}, {"t": 862.97, "end": 864.97, "text": "which is absolutely pure,"}, {"t": 864.97, "end": 868.97, "text": "and filled with universal consciousness,"}, {"t": 868.97, "end": 869.97, "text": "Vishu, Puranam."}, {"t": 869.97, "end": 875.76, "text": "And fills the whole universe with bliss."}, {"t": 875.76, "end": 880.32, "text": "Shakti, Sangam, Sangkhyubd,"}, {"t": 880.32, "end": 882.32, "text": "Shakta, Vesha, Vasadikam,"}, {"t": 882.32, "end": 885.32, "text": "Yatsukham, Brahm, Tatta, Saita, Taksukham,"}, {"t": 885.32, "end": 887.32, "text": "Swakyam, Vichade."}, {"t": 887.32, "end": 891.32, "text": "When you are united with your other partner,"}, {"t": 891.32, "end": 894.32, "text": "life partner, say a woman,"}, {"t": 894.32, "end": 899.86, "text": "or for a woman, a man."}, {"t": 899.86, "end": 904.86, "text": "And when you are absolutely embracing each other,"}, {"t": 904.86, "end": 911.86, "text": "and that Sukha, that experience of joy,"}, {"t": 911.86, "end": 914.86, "text": "which rises there,"}, {"t": 914.86, "end": 917.86, "text": "actually is the joy of Brahmins."}, {"t": 918.86, "end": 921.86, "text": "If it is known by trick,"}, {"t": 921.86, "end": 924.86, "text": "there also trick will do."}, {"t": 924.86, "end": 927.86, "text": "If you don't know how to do it,"}, {"t": 927.86, "end": 933.14, "text": "you are as good as beast."}, {"t": 933.14, "end": 936.14, "text": "You are union of two beasts."}, {"t": 936.14, "end": 942.46, "text": "Yes, it is everywhere. It is trick."}, {"t": 942.46, "end": 944.46, "text": "Lehna, Manthana, Kothai,"}, {"t": 944.46, "end": 946.46, "text": "Sthri, Sukhasya, Barath, Sumrata,"}, {"t": 946.46, "end": 951.46, "text": "Shakti, Bhave, Bhide, Vesha, Bhave, Ananda, Samplua."}, {"t": 951.46, "end": 955.46, "text": "O Devi, not only in union,"}, {"t": 955.46, "end": 958.46, "text": "union of the two partners,"}, {"t": 958.46, "end": 960.46, "text": "but by remembrance of these,"}, {"t": 960.46, "end": 962.46, "text": "this sexual union,"}, {"t": 962.46, "end": 967.31, "text": "if you have trick,"}, {"t": 967.31, "end": 969.31, "text": "at the time of that remembrance also,"}, {"t": 969.31, "end": 972.31, "text": "you will get entry in God consciousness."}, {"t": 972.31, "end": 975.31, "text": "This is not Shaktopaya."}, {"t": 975.31, "end": 978.31, "text": "This is Shaktopaya."}, {"t": 978.31, "end": 980.31, "text": "That is also Shaktopaya."}, {"t": 980.31, "end": 989.2, "text": "Yes, that is in the end."}, {"t": 989.2, "end": 993.2, "text": "Ananda, Mahati, Pravte, Dreshtiva, Bhandeve, Chirat,"}, {"t": 993.2, "end": 997.2, "text": "Ananda, Udgatam, Diyata, Tanmayas, Tatlai."}, {"t": 997.2, "end": 1002.2, "text": "It is not only matter of sex,"}, {"t": 1002.2, "end": 1006.2, "text": "say matter of appearance also,"}, {"t": 1006.2, "end": 1008.2, "text": "you will carry you to that God consciousness."}, {"t": 1008.2, "end": 1012.58, "text": "When something appears to you,"}, {"t": 1012.58, "end": 1015.58, "text": "after a long interval of time,"}, {"t": 1015.58, "end": 1017.58, "text": "for instance, your son,"}, {"t": 1017.58, "end": 1021.58, "text": "who was in America for 20 long years,"}, {"t": 1021.58, "end": 1023.58, "text": "and he has returned,"}, {"t": 1023.58, "end": 1025.58, "text": "and you perceive him,"}, {"t": 1025.58, "end": 1030.68, "text": "it is a surprise,"}, {"t": 1030.68, "end": 1031.68, "text": "without knowing,"}, {"t": 1031.68, "end": 1033.68, "text": "without receiving his letter"}, {"t": 1033.68, "end": 1035.68, "text": "or without being prepared to receive him,"}, {"t": 1035.68, "end": 1037.68, "text": "but you just see him."}, {"t": 1037.68, "end": 1040.68, "text": "At that time, that joy,"}, {"t": 1040.68, "end": 1042.68, "text":