here must be difference, because Lord Shiva has kept this sutra also of the same meaning."}, {"t": 1373.67, "end": 1374.67, "text": "Trapadai Dhanupranam."}, {"t": 1375.67, "end": 1378.67, "text": "In 3 states, you must give life to that fourth state."}, {"t": 1379.67, "end": 1380.67, "text": "This is the meaning of this sutra."}, {"t": 1381.67, "end": 1385.67, "text": "And the previous sutra, the meaning of the previous sutra is also the same."}, {"t": 1385.67, "end": 1389.67, "text": "Treshu Chaturtham in 3 states, you must insert the fourth state."}, {"t": 1390.67, "end": 1391.67, "text": "This is the same."}, {"t": 1392.67, "end": 1394.67, "text": "Same meaning comes out of these 2 sutras."}, {"t": 1397.14, "end": 1400.14, "text": "But there is a difference of understanding in these 2 sutras."}, {"t": 1401.14, "end": 1409.14, "text": "In first previous sutra, it is understood that in wakefulness, in dreaming state and in dreamless state,"}, {"t": 1410.14, "end": 1414.14, "text": "you have to insert the state of puria by and by."}, {"t": 1415.14, "end": 1418.14, "text": "So that all these 3 states become one with puria."}, {"t": 1419.14, "end": 1424.14, "text": "But in this sutra, in this sutra, and in our Sarvadashan,"}, {"t": 1425.14, "end": 1430.14, "text": "or the Madhanteshu, Sreshthya Samaar, Nirupatiya, Bangya, Nirupatiya, Nirupatiya, Isisya."}, {"t": 1431.14, "end": 1437.14, "text": "In this sutra, it is said that in each and every act of your daily life,"}, {"t": 1438.14, "end": 1441.14, "text": "you have to insert that puria with the trick by the trick."}, {"t": 1442.14, "end": 1443.14, "text": "This is the difference."}, {"t": 1444.14, "end": 1446.14, "text": "Of these 2 sutras."}, {"t": 1447.14, "end": 1449.14, "text": "Not to hear that, not the viral."}, {"t": 1450.14, "end": 1451.14, "text": "Yes, not the viral."}, {"t": 1452.14, "end": 1453.14, "text": "Yes, we will do this much."}, {"t": 1454.14, "end": 1455.14, "text": "Coffee."}]}